{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And he shall bring that which is for the sin-offering first.</b> Not with respect to the altar, for it is established with us that outer sin-offerings are eaten. Rather what is 'and he shall bring'? And he shall pinch the neck, and sprinkle, and what remains of the blood he shall squeeze out." "<b>And he shall not divide.</b> One sign he shall pinch, and not two."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:10:05.320741638Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}